<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 23.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 23.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- The first liver transplant operation in Estonia will take place in the autumn.</p>
<p>- Birth rates in Estonia have substantially increased only on Saaremaa, the country's largest island.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
